  "notes": "PRIMARY SOURCE: the club's own scorecard table on broragolfclub.co.uk/the_course_overview (click 'Open Scorecard'), which publishes six columns. Top-level 'par'/'handicap' on each hole are the standard men's card (White and Yellow share identical par and stroke index); use 'parByTee'/'handicapByTee' for the Red-men, Yellow-ladies and composite variants. All six columns were verified to sum correctly to their printed OUT/IN/TOTAL rows, and every stroke-index column is a valid 1-18 set with odds outward / evens inward. CROSS-CHECKS: Golfshake independently lists White 6211/par 70/SSS 70, Yellow 5951/par 70/SSS 69, Red 5273/par 71/SSS 71 - identical totals to the official card. GolfSherpa reproduces all 18 stroke indexes for the White/Yellow men's card and all 18 Red yardages and stroke indexes identically. DISAGREEMENTS: (1) GolfSherpa's yardages are a stale card - it shows hole 11 as 442 (White) / 412 (Yellow) par 4 for a 6156-yard par-69/70 total, and hole 6 Yellow as 174. The club's current card has hole 11 at 497 (White) / 491 (Yellow) as a par 5 for 6211/par 70, and the club's own hole-11 page confirms 'Achrimsdale Burn (497 yards par 5)'. The widely-quoted '6156 yards' figure is the superseded card. (2) The club's hole-6 and hole-9 narrative pages say 174 and 152 yards, which match neither White (190/162) nor Yellow (164/149) on the current card - those two prose pages appear stale; the scorecard table was preferred. (3) Golfshake also lists a 'Blue' tee at 5099 yds, par 74, SSS 73 that does not appear on the club's published card - not included here. RATINGS: SSS values are from Golfshake. No WHS Course Rating / Slope is published on the club site; GolfSherpa quotes CR/Slope of White 70.0/118, Yellow-men 68.9/116, Yellow-ladies 74.2/128, Red-men 65.8/110, but these are derived from its stale 6156-yard card and one search result reported slope 110 for White instead of 118, so slope/CR is NOT included as verified data."
